5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"We should judge these plans by their longevity, not their opening day glamour.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I am concerned about the ground conditions and the limited number of firms available.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I need to understand the long-term financial burden on the city's budget.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who will actually maintain this place once the ribbon is cut?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,The site has specific drainage and usage patterns we must respect.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The last decade of our schemes shows a pattern of decay.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, exactly. The clay subsoil here is unpredictable.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, the maintenance rota is shrinking every year, which worries me.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, yes. We need to know who is left to do the work.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,We must look at how people actually cross the site daily.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look into the condition of previous works and the habitat fund terms.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I need to check the regional firms and the depot phasing notes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will examine the upkeep ledger and the groundskeeping roll.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the volunteer groups and the groundskeeping roll.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the drainage callouts and the timed counts of crossings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let us see what the data says before we commit to any aesthetic.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,The earth-moving quotes will tell us if the timeline is realistic.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mio,,"If the upkeep cost triples, this plan is a trap.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"If no one is left to mow the grass, the plan fails.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,The ground will tell us the truth about what is feasible.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
