60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Candidate C, Wetland Restoration, fits the habitat fund terms perfectly.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, but the earth-moving risk is high for reshaping drainage.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, but the upkeep for water-managed ground is high, isn't it?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the volunteer group upriver already does habitat tasks.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, the drainage callouts prove we need this. The heat is a problem.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,The fund pays for the water management. That is the key.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"The two firms can handle shallow work, but not deep excavation.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mio,,"If the volunteer group handles the habitat, the city saves on labor.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"The other volunteer group is busy with sports, so we can't rely on them.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,The boardwalks provide firm ground for the crossings we counted.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Candidate A, Market Plaza, requires hard surfaces the fund won't cover.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, correct. And the center cannot be hoarded off for construction.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, so A is financially and logistically impossible.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, yes. And the upkeep for paved areas is lower, but the capital is missing.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the heat readings make a paved plaza a liability in summer.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Candidate B, Woodland Walk, is funded, but the upkeep is triple.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, and the eastern avenue planting record shows high mortality.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, that confirms the high cost. We cannot afford the aftercare.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the volunteer group is already stretched. They can't do more planting.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the gravel paths might not hold up to the heavy traffic we counted.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
